   {
    "row": 7,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 10,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "strategy, TATTOO consistently yields steady improvements as the number of responses N increases,",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 623,
     "end": 719
    },
    "digest": "e7ac69bbfc311b19b1aed61c7bbc5b4506c037fd478977c827dd1e3111bae3cc"
   },
   {
    "row": 8,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 10,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "whereas other baseline PRMs often plateau. For example, in beam search, TATTOO improves from",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 719,
     "end": 811
    },
    "digest": "00f2513367cb9172e7a2cc5169bada0c89b13e2bf11c0ded2d2315ff28dd8156"
   },
   {
    "row": 9,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 10,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "45.0% to 54.8%, while GenPRM saturates around 51% and Skywork-PRM remains below 46%.",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 811,
     "end": 895
    },
    "digest": "1b54aff66013c97016e3a688917342c9384affc2cafc968f86cc0a95f52bbda2"
   }
